          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Components the latest deployment created, updated or deleted in the org. A FULL deployment sends the whole package.xml, so the number of deployed items is the size of the project, not the size of the release. Requires a recent sfdx-hardis version on the monitoring pipeline (empty until then).",
